                                        "designed to streamline grading, coursework, and student " +
                                        "performance tracking. It provides powerful tools for tutors " +
                                        "to manage modules, record grades, and monitor progress, " +
                                        "while giving students a clear view of their results and " +
                                        "coursework submissions."
                            )
